{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05413","headline":"赠吏部孙员外济 · 张谔","name":"赠吏部孙员外济","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子爱贤才，星郎入拜来。\n明光朝半下，建礼直初回。\n名带含香发，文随绮幕开。\n披云自有镜，从此照仙台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}